License guide

- Code (public/, functions/, workers/, scripts/, tests/, package.json, .gitignore, and the empty data/books.csv template):
  MIT License. See LICENSE-MIT.
- Documentation (README.md, SECURITY.md, this LICENSE file):
  Creative Commons Attribution 4.0 International (CC BY 4.0). See LICENSE-CC-BY-4.0.
  Attribution: satoshin-san / book-finder-starter.
- Not included: book data, artwork, music, voices, characters, and any API keys.
- Third-party services (such as the Calil library API) have their own terms.
